# Warp models

When Warp, Shuttle, or Reed is running a coding step, use the model in `.warp/config.yaml`.

Default: `claude-sonnet-5-5-high` (Claude Sonnet 5.5 High). The slug must match the Cursor model picker. If it is missing from the picker, stop and ask. Do not fall back to another slug. A value in `.warp/config.yaml` overrides this default. Judgment and notification steps may use a cheaper model; coding and Bugbot-fix loops may not.
